{"questions":[{"id":"Q135","typeId":"會員費逆推","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S01:p3"],"prompt":"定價合計19500元的交通票，直接買打九折另加150元；會員八折免處理費。含會員費總支出相同，會員費多少元？","answer":"2100","explanation":"19500×0.9+150−19500×0.8＝2100。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x+19500*0.8=19500*0.9+150","root":"2100","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"2250","misconception":"將150元處理費重複加兩次；直接方案只收一次處理費。"},{"id":"c2","text":"1950","misconception":"只計九折與八折差額，漏加直接購買另收的150元。"},{"id":"c3","text":"2100"},{"id":"c4","text":"17700","misconception":"只算直接方案九折加150元的總支出，漏扣會員仍須支付的八折票價。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q137","typeId":"容器購置","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S14:p7"],"prompt":"每個新水桶容量4公升、售75元。買滿12公升泉水連同所需3個新桶共705元。每公升泉水多少元？","answer":"40","explanation":"12x+3×75＝705，x＝40。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"12*x+3*75=705","root":"40","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"40"},{"id":"c2","text":"160","misconception":"這是每桶4公升泉水的價格；每公升價格還須除以4。"},{"id":"c3","text":"52.5","misconception":"只扣一個新桶75元；12公升需用三個4公升新桶。"},{"id":"c4","text":"225","misconception":"只算出三個新水桶總價225元，未扣除桶費後再除以12公升。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q140","typeId":"周長列式","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S02:p3","S03:p1","S09:p1","S13:p1","S18:p1"],"prompt":"矩形長為寬的4倍少7公分，周長86公分。求面積（平方公分）。","answer":"330","explanation":"設寬x，2(x+4x−7)＝86，x＝10，長33，面積330。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"2*(x+4*x-7)=86","root":"10","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"100","misconception":"只把寬10平方，錯把矩形當成正方形；長為33。"},{"id":"c2","text":"660","misconception":"求得長33、寬10後，錯把面積公式多乘2。"},{"id":"c3","text":"43","misconception":"把半周長當成面積；面積應由寬10乘長33求得。"},{"id":"c4","text":"330"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q141","typeId":"正方形等邊","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S18:p1"],"prompt":"正方形相鄰兩邊分別標示7x−8與3x+16公分。求周長（公分）。","answer":"136","explanation":"7x−8＝3x+16，x＝6，邊長34，周長136。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"7*x-8=3*x+16","root":"6","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"136"},{"id":"c2","text":"34","misconception":"只求得正方形一條邊長；周長應為四條邊的總和。"},{"id":"c3","text":"68","misconception":"只加相鄰兩條邊，漏掉另外兩條等長邊。"},{"id":"c4","text":"6","misconception":"這是使兩條邊相等的x值；周長須先求邊長，再乘4。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q142","typeId":"梯形面積","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S10:p1","S12:p2"],"prompt":"梯形下底比上底3倍多4公分，高8公分，面積112平方公分。求下底（公分）。","answer":"22","explanation":"設上底x，(x+3x+4)×8÷2＝112，x＝6，下底22。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(x+3*x+4)*8/2=112","root":"6","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"6","misconception":"這是梯形上底的長度；下底應再乘3並加4。"},{"id":"c2","text":"22"},{"id":"c3","text":"11.5","misconception":"梯形面積漏除以2，誤列(x+3x+4)×8＝112。"},{"id":"c4","text":"28","misconception":"這是上底與下底的總和；還須利用倍數差關係分開兩底。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q146","typeId":"多邊形內角","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S09:p1"],"prompt":"一個六邊形（可為凹多邊形）的內角依序為x、2x、3x、4x、5x、6x度。求x（度）。","answer":"240/7","explanation":"六邊形內角和720度，21x＝720。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"21*x=720","root":"240/7","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"120/7","misconception":"把六邊形內角和錯當成360度；應用(6−2)×180＝720。"},{"id":"c2","text":"240/7"},{"id":"c3","text":"360/7","misconception":"將六邊形錯分成6個三角形，誤用6×180度；應從一頂點分成4個。"},{"id":"c4","text":"120","misconception":"將六個內角當成等角平分720；它們的倍數係數合計21。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q148","typeId":"折繩量深","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p2","S12:p4"],"prompt":"同一條測繩折成4等段，每段比井深多2公尺；折成5等段，每段比井深少3公尺。井深多少公尺？","answer":"23","explanation":"4(x+2)＝5(x−3)，x＝23。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"4*(x+2)=5*(x-3)","root":"23","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"17","misconception":"展開4(x+2)時只加2，漏乘4；正確應加8。"},{"id":"c2","text":"5","misconception":"將每段多2與少3直接相加當井深，忽略同一條繩折成不同段數。"},{"id":"c3","text":"11","misconception":"展開5(x−3)時只減3，漏乘5；正確應減15。"},{"id":"c4","text":"23"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q149","typeId":"年齡和差","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S03:p1","S10:p1","S11:p1","S16:p2","S18:p1"],"prompt":"宜蓁與母親今年合計64歲，4年後母親年齡是宜蓁的3倍。宜蓁今年幾歲？","answer":"14","explanation":"64−x+4＝3(x+4)，得x＝14。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"64-x+4=3*(x+4)","root":"14","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"14"},{"id":"c2","text":"17","misconception":"只讓母親增加4歲卻沒讓宜蓁增加4歲；兩人年齡須同步增加。"},{"id":"c3","text":"18","misconception":"這是宜蓁4年後的年齡；題目要求今年，須減4。"},{"id":"c4","text":"16","misconception":"直接把今年總年齡以1:3分配，忽略倍數發生在4年後。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q155","typeId":"上下坡往返","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S10:p1","S16:p2"],"prompt":"昱衡沿同一路徑登山，上坡每小時4公里、下坡每小時6公里，來回合計5小時。單程幾公里？","answer":"12","explanation":"x/4+x/6＝5，x＝12。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x/4+x/6=5","root":"12","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"50","misconception":"把兩段速度相加再乘總時間，錯讓上坡與下坡都走滿5小時。"},{"id":"c2","text":"25/2","misconception":"把上下坡速度4與6取算術平均5，再將總距離除以2；兩段時間不相同。"},{"id":"c3","text":"12"},{"id":"c4","text":"24","misconception":"這是來回總路程；題目要求單程，還須除以2。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q156","typeId":"順逆風總路程","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S16:p2"],"prompt":"探測艇逆流每小時12公里、順流每小時18公里，往返共5小時。來回總路程幾公里？","answer":"72","explanation":"單程x，x/12+x/18＝5，x＝36；來回72。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x/12+x/18=5","root":"36","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"150","misconception":"把順逆流速度相加後乘5，錯讓兩段都花了完整5小時。"},{"id":"c2","text":"36","misconception":"這是單程路程；題目要求來回總路程，應再乘2。"},{"id":"c3","text":"75","misconception":"以順逆流速度的算術平均15乘5，忽略往返等距而時間不同。"},{"id":"c4","text":"72"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q158","typeId":"數線追及","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S15:p2"],"prompt":"兩台機器同時從數線−18與30往右，後方速度是前方4倍。相遇處座標是多少？","answer":"46","explanation":"前方走x，4x＝48+x，x＝16，相遇30+16＝46。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"4*x=48+x","root":"16","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"64","misconception":"這是後方機器走的距離；座標應用起點−18加64。"},{"id":"c2","text":"46"},{"id":"c3","text":"16","misconception":"這是前方機器走的距離；相遇座標還要加上起點30。"},{"id":"c4","text":"39.6","misconception":"追及時錯用速度和5份，算前方走48/5；同向追及應使用速度差3份。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q162","typeId":"產量盈虧","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p2"],"prompt":"加工站若每小時做42件，期限到還差18件；若每小時做48件，期限到多做30件。訂單共有幾件？","answer":"354","explanation":"42x+18＝48x−30，期限8小時，訂單354件。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"42*x+18=48*x-30","root":"8","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"384","misconception":"這是每小時48件、8小時的產量，應扣除多做的30件。"},{"id":"c2","text":"354"},{"id":"c3","text":"102","misconception":"把期限算成(30−18)/(48−42)＝2，盈虧差應為30+18。"},{"id":"c4","text":"336","misconception":"這是每小時42件、8小時的實際產量，還要加欠交18件。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"}]}